    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d111">

                <pb facs="0316" n="296" sameAs="frus:frus1946v02/pg296"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">C.F.M. Files: Lot
                    M–88: Box 2061: CFM Documents</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Proposals by the United States
                            Delegation to the Council of Foreign
                            Ministers</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        C.F.M. (46) 55</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-05-07">7 May 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Provisions Regarding General
                        Economic Relations: Treaties of Peace With Rumania, Bulgaria, and
                        Hungary</hi></p>
                <p>There is attached a draft article proposed by the United States Delegation for
                    inclusion in the treaty of peace with Rumania. The United States Delegation
                    proposes that the same article, <hi rendition="#italic">mutatis <pb facs="0317"
                            n="297" xml:id="pg297"/> mutandis</hi>, be included in the treaties of
                    peace with Bulgaria and Hungary.</p>



                <xi:include href="d111-a1.xml" xpointer="d111-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d111-a2.xml" xpointer="d111-a2"/>
            </div>
